Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the CES stage, Roland. Have fun!\N欢迎来到CES舞台，博乐仁，祝你玩得开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want you to think back to the time before electricity.\N我想让你回想一下电出现之前的时代。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world moved at the pace of people, but horses stretched our distances.\N世界曾以人的速度前行，但马匹却拓展了我们的活动范围。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Steam powered our machines and ideas moved only as fast as a letter or a human voice.\N蒸汽驱动了我们的机器，而思想的传播速度仅限于一封信件或人声的传递。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then electricity arrived.\N随后电力来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This general purpose technology became the foundation of modern life.\N这项通用技术已成为现代生活的基础。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:56.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It turned night into day, amplified human capabilities,\N它让黑夜变为白昼，放大了人类的能力，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:01:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,boosted productivity and powered progress that once felt out of reach.\N提升了生产力，推动了曾经遥不可及的进步。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,At Siemens, we brought this world to life.\N在西门子，我们让这个世界栩栩如生。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pioneering telecommunications and electric grids.\N开创性的电信与电网技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developing the machines that accelerated mass production, moving people and goods via electric trains.\N开发加速大规模生产的机器，通过电力火车实现人员和货物的运输。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scaling the benefits of electricity all around the world.\N让电力的益处遍及全球。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fast forward one and a half centuries later,\N一个半世纪后，又一种通用技术已经到来，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,another general purpose technology has arrived, and this time it's not about energy.\N而这一次，它与能源无关。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about intelligence.\N这关乎智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Artificial Intelligence will be as transformative for this century as electricity was for the last.\N人工智能将对本世纪产生深远影响，正如电力对上个世纪的影响一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's redefining how we design and manufacture products.\N它正在重新定义我们设计和制造产品的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:02:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the phones in your hands to the cars you drive.\N从你手中的手机到你驾驶的汽车。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's revolutionizing how we build and operate infrastructure including buildings just like this one.\N它正在彻底改变我们建造和运营基础设施的方式，包括像这样的建筑。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's allowing us to make entire systems, grids, cities, economies more adaptive and more efficient.\N它让我们能够使整个系统、电网、城市和经济变得更加适应性强和高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,A century ago, Siemens helped build the world in the light of electricity.\N一个世纪前，西门子曾助力世界在电的光芒中崛起。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we get to do it again in the age of intelligence.\N现在，我们将在智能时代再次开启这一进程。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are powering the industrial AI revolution.\N我们正推动工业AI革命。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has already begun, and it's picking up steam faster than steam ever did.\N它已经开始了，而且势头之快，远超蒸汽本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, steam took 60 years to transform society.\N事实上，蒸汽机花了60年才彻底改变社会。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity.\N电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 computers, 15 for AI.\N30台电脑，15台用于AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:03:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're looking at seven years or less before intelligence is embedded in the system we rely on every day.\N我们预计，七年或更短时间内，智能将融入我们每天依赖的系统之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that changes something fundamentally,\N这从根本上改变了事物的本质，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,because when an AI enters a physical system, it stops being a feature.\N因为当人工智能进入物理系统后，它就不再只是一个功能了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It becomes a force.\N它便成为一种力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,A force with direct real world impact.\N一种具有直接现实世界影响的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A force that transforms how we design and build, how factories produce,\N一种改变我们设计与建造方式、工厂生产方式、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,how infrastructure operates, how the world powers itself.\N基础设施运行方式，以及世界自我供电方式的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we do it?\N那么，我们该怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can we make this happen?\N我们该如何让这件事成为现实？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can we do all of this at speed and scale and at the same time, in a way that it's reliable and safe and\N我们该如何在保证可靠、安全、杜绝幻觉的前提下，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,hallucination is not acceptable when AI is deployed in the industrial world?\N快速且大规模地实现这一切——尤其是在 AI 被部署到工业世界时？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:04:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we are making it easy for you to scale industrial AI in the real world\N今天，我们让您轻松实现工业AI在真实系统中的规模化，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,systems to create real world impact.\N创造真实世界的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are bringing together AI powered technologies, industrial domain know how and the right partners.\N我们正汇聚人工智能驱动的技术、工业领域的专业知识以及合适的合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole thing is connected by data, valuable industrial data and all in one place.\N整个系统通过数据连接在一起，汇集了宝贵的工业数据，全部集中在一个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In our Siemens Xcelerator marketplace.\N在我们的西门子 Xcelerator 市场平台上。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's have a look at these elements one by one.\N那么，我们来逐一看看这些元素。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's start first with the right technologies.\N首先，让我们从正确的技术开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is about software hardware compute highly performant compute with GPUs.\N它关乎软件、硬件和计算，是基于 GPU 的高性能计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course it is about data.\N当然，这关乎数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here comes the good news.\N好消息来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many companies have already some important elements in place, but this does not make them AI ready yet.\N许多公司已经具备了一些重要元素，但这并不意味着它们已经做好了AI准备。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Digital twins can simulate and software can solve problems,\N数字孪生可以进行模拟，软件也能解决问题，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they do not recommend what to do next in the real world.\N但它们无法在现实世界中推荐下一步该怎么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is CPU based with AI needs GPUs to deploy its full power and speed,\N计算依赖于CPU，而AI需要GPU才能发挥其全部性能和速度，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and too often data is fragmented, trapped in silos and unused.\N但数据常常被分割，困在孤岛中，无法得到有效利用。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why it is so important to have an end to end AI industrial stack to make impact in the real world.\N因此，构建一个端到端的AI工业栈，才能真正对现实世界产生影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:39.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at Siemens, we are able to build this because we have been working with AI\N在西门子，我们之所以能够实现这一点，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,for industry for more than 50 years.\N是因为我们为工业领域开展人工智能研究已有超过50年的历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Siemens has more than 1,500 AI experts,\N如今，西门子拥有超过1500名AI专家，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and all our engineers live in both worlds in the digital and in the real world.\N我们的所有工程师都同时活跃在数字世界和现实世界之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:06:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all our colleagues, over 250,000 of them, bring deep domain knowhow in our 30 industrial verticals.\N我们超过25万名同事，在30个工业领域都具备深厚的专业知识。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's because for decades, Siemens has been helping customers in the United States and all over\N正是因为几十年来，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the world to automate manufacturing, to run railway networks,\N西门子一直在帮助美国及全球各地的客户实现制造自动化，运营铁路网络，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to design and operate grids, or to operate buildings more efficiently.\N设计和运行电网，或更高效地管理建筑。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, today, in one out of three manufacturing machines worldwide runs a Siemens controller.\N事实上，如今全球每三台制造设备中就有一台搭载了西门子控制器。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:37.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,With our software, you can build the most comprehensive digital twin of products and\N通过我们的软件，您可以构建产品最全面的数字孪生，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cost of a whole manufacturing site.\N以及整个制造厂区的成本模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we are adding AI Decades of experience in software, hardware and AI And this experience means we have the\N现在，我们正在将AI融入其中。凭借在软件、硬件和AI领域数十年的经验，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,domain know how to identify which data matter and how to cluster it.\N我们具备了识别哪些数据重要以及如何对数据进行聚类的专业知识。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which AI applications make sense and which decisions should be left to humans.\N哪些AI应用有意义，哪些决策应留给人类。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally.\N最后。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partners for industrial AI to make use of all of this industrial design, manufacturing and operating data.\N我们与工业AI的合作伙伴携手，充分利用所有工业设计、制造和运营数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need a huge amount of compute.\N你需要大量的计算能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gigantic centralized AI factories that are run by our partners like AWS or Microsoft,\N由我们的合作伙伴如亚马逊云科技或微软运营的巨大集中式AI工厂，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also at the edge, very close to your machines, to your infrastructure.\N同时也部署在边缘，非常贴近你的机器和基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this massive GPU process powered compute digital twins no longer explore just thousands\N借助这种由大规模GPU算力驱动的计算数字孪生技术，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,of options, but hundreds of thousands of them.\N不再仅限于探索数千种方案，而是可探索数十万种方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complex industrial foundation models can get trained on unprecedented amounts of industrial data.\N复杂的工业基础模型可以基于前所未有的工业数据进行训练。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a digital twin can control a whole plant in real time.\N数字孪生可以实时控制整个工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,When these things come together, the right technologies, industry domain knowhow, and the right partners.\N当这些要素汇聚在一起时，也就是正确的技术、行业领域的专业知识，以及合适的合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when we stop just reporting issues and start anticipating them.\N这时，我们不再只是报告问题，而是开始预见问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when humans stop reacting to errors because machines have started to act and adjust autonomously.\N这时人类开始不再对错误做出反应，因为机器已经能够自主行动并自我调整。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when companies can turn ideas into real world impact with speed, quality and efficiency.\N这时，企业便能以速度、质量和效率将创意转化为现实世界的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the industrial AI revolution.\N这是工业AI的革命。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, I mentioned partners, the right partners, the best partners.\N现在，我提到了合作伙伴，正确的合作伙伴，最好的合作伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And including a very special friend of mine.\N还包括一位我非常特别的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we hit it off immediately.\N我们一见如故。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has a visionary engineering mindset.\N他具有远见卓识的工程思维。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:09:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He thinks through problems from first principles.\N他从基本原理出发思考问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He anticipates the next development step of AI technology.\N他预见了人工智能技术的下一步发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he has both bold vision and the ability to make things happen.\N他既有远大的愿景，又有将想法变为现实的能力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Jensen Huang.\N欢迎黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Roland! Happy new year!\N博乐仁！新年快乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:44.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy new year! Happy new year! Please 200 years old. You've seen a few of these Industrial revolutions.\N新年快乐！新年快乐！祝你两百岁！你已经见证过几次工业革命了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are not quite 200 years, but we are heading for 175.\N我们还没到200年，但正朝着175年迈进。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.\N没错，完全正确。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we came a long way with our partnership too, right?\N我们的合作也走过了很长的路，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, we kicked it off a couple of years ago.\N我的意思是，我们几年前就启动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember that very well.\N我对此记忆犹新。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have the same vision, industrial AI operating system that we want to build,\N拥有相同的愿景，我们想要打造的工业AI操作系统，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,huge opportunities for our customers.\N为客户带来了巨大的机遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what's with you?\N你咋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are we on this journey?\N我们在这段旅程中走到哪一步了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know? Yeah, it's it's an incredible thing.\N你知道吗？是啊，这真是件了不起的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we, we did a press conference at Siemens headquarters in Munich.\N所以我们就在慕尼黑西门子总部举行了一场新闻发布会。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many? Yeah. How many years ago was that?\N多少年前的事了？对，多少年前？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,2022. It was only 2022. Okay.\N2022年，才刚到2022年而已。好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was three years ago.\N是的，那是三年前的事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we spoke about this moment in fact.\N事实上，我们曾讨论过这一时刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:30.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Siemens is is unquestionably at the foundation of every industry that we\N西门子无疑是我们在参与的每一个行业、
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,participate in, that the world builds on.\N全球所依赖的基石。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:42.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, we had a vision that that, Siemens and this was your vision to turn Siemens into a software defined company in a\N而且，我们有一个愿景，即让西门子转型为一家软件定义的公司，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,lot of ways, described it in a way very similar to a computer company.\N这正是你的愿景，从很多方面来看，将西门子描述成一家类似计算机公司的企业。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:52.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it would it would, of course, have the underlying infrastructure of computing,\N当然，它将具备计算的底层基础设施，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but mostly on top, your infrastructure software, artificial intelligence.\N但更重要的是，其上层是基础设施软件和人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:11:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's going to revolutionize the way things are designed, simulated, planned and operated.\N它将彻底改变事物的设计、仿真、规划和运营方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that was the vision you described.\N这就是你所描述的愿景。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we spoke about three years ago.\N我们三年前就谈过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here we are.\N我们到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, here we are at the beginning of that journey.\N你知道，我们正处在那段旅程的起点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, all the pieces are now finally coming together.\N现在，所有要素终于都汇聚到了一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems to.\N看起来是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And talking about what you achieved.\N说到你所取得的成就。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought an example, you know, that HD Hyundai. I mean, they built ships.\N我举个例子，就是 HD 现代，他们本来就是造船的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,huge ships, and and shipyards, by the way.\N巨大的船只，还有船坞，顺便提一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they use our technology.\N他们使用我们的技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're sitting on Nvidia.\N你手里握着英伟达。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a digital twin of an entire ship.\N这是一个完整船舶的数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every nut and bolt is in there is incredible.\N每一个螺母和螺栓都精准到位，令人惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is the full CAD of the ship visiting the pavilion.\N我的意思是，这艘船访问展馆的完整CAD图。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Precise digital twin.\N精准的数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and you see also the the the people working on the ships.\N而且你还能看到在船上工作的那些人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You simulate everything.\N你模拟一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the way, these ships are they look alike.\N顺便说一下，这些船看起来很像。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the body is the same, but each of them is individual.\N所以身体是一样的，但它们各自都是独立的个体。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:56.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you really have to be very, very clear how you design that you optimize in the\N因此，你必须非常明确地设计，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,digital world and then you build it, for that.\N先在数字世界中优化，然后再据此建造。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's where our whole stack comes together.\N这正是我们整个技术栈融合在一起的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complimentary technology.\N互补技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for the photorealistic, representation we use Omniverse.\N而对于逼真的视觉呈现，我们使用Omniverse。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this was really quite a perfect. Yeah.\N这真是再完美不过了。是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is quite a perfect example of the type of work that we do together in this realization of this digital\N这正是我们共同实现数字孪生理念的绝佳范例，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,twin idea that you would design, every aspect of engineering.\N从工程的每一个方面进行设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:30.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not just the not just the CAD, but the computing, the electronics, all of it would be integrated and then and built into a\N不仅仅是CAD，还包括计算、电子等所有环节都将被整合，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,digital twin, it would, of course, run all of the software in the digital twin.\N并构建到一个数字孪生体中，当然，它会运行数字孪生体中的所有软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in the future, I hope that's the ship.\N希望未来，那就是那艘船。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:43.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The digital twin of a ship will actually put it in the ocean,\N船舶的数字孪生体将真实地将其置于海洋中，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,a virtual simulation of the ocean and see it completely operate.\N通过虚拟的海洋模拟，观察其完全运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Yeah.\N没错，正是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have only one option to get it onto water.\N而你只有一个办法能把它放到水里。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If then you have a problem, by the way. So.\N如果你遇到问题的话，顺便说一下。所以。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we talked about bringing our partners up to the next level.\N嗯，我们刚才讨论了把合作伙伴提升到下一个水平。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, the whole idea is obviously to take these examples and scale them even faster.\N而且，整个想法显然是要利用这些例子，实现更快的扩展。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, to make it AI enabled, I'm talking about industrially, I would really it's the real world.\N当然，要实现AI赋能，我指的是工业领域，这正是真实世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we picked five areas of collaboration where we want to intensify.\N我们选定了五个合作领域，希望在这些领域加强合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and that's, good news for our customers too, I guess.\N而且，这对我们的客户来说也是个好消息，我想。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me start with the first one.\N让我先从第一个开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take them off one by one.\N一个一个地取下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first one is AI native chip design.\N第一个是AI原生芯片设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, if it comes to chip design, I don't need to tell you something.\N说到芯片设计，这点我就不必多说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you're with each next generation.\N显然，你们正紧跟下一代的步伐。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're getting closer to the physical limits.\N你正越来越接近物理极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell me what what the challenges are and what can we do.\N所以告诉我，面临的挑战是什么，我们能做些什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:42.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, let's use let's use, our latest generation that we just announced yesterday as an example,\N好吧，我们以昨天刚发布的最新一代产品 Vera Rubin 为例，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin, Vera Rubin, in order to build the latest generation GPU, people think that our GPU is a chip.\N要构建最新的 GPU，人们通常以为我们的 GPU 只是一颗芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is a chip.\N它是一颗芯片。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It consists of a chip, but ultimately, in order for these GPUs to scale up to process the level of AI\N它由一块芯片组成，但为了使这些GPU能够扩展到处理前沿AI所需的算力，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:14:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's necessary at the frontier, these GPUs are essentially one giant rack,\N这些GPU本质上就是一台巨大的机架，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this entire rack is, in the case of Vera Rubin, 240kW.\N而在Vera Rubin的案例中，整台机架的功耗高达240千瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It consists of altogether 220 trillion transistors.\N它总共包含220万亿个晶体管。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We had to design six different unique chips CPU, GPU, networking, multiple types of networking switches.\N我们必须设计六种不同的独特芯片，包括 CPU、GPU、网络芯片以及多种类型的网络交换机。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is for scale up, one is for scale out,\N一个是用于纵向扩展，一个是用于横向扩展，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a smart net and a data processor for storage all for AI memory basically.\N再配上一个智能网络和数据处理器，用于存储，本质上都是为了AI内存。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:34.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of this stuff came together is 220 trillion transistors,\N所有这些技术汇聚在一起，形成了拥有220万亿个晶体管、重达两吨、
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is two tons and 150,000 engineering years came together to build this one system that we announced yesterday.\N耗时15万个人年工程量的系统，这是我们昨天宣布的全新产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in order to do this perfectly at a rhythm that our company runs at the level of chip design,\N为了以我们公司芯片设计、系统设计、系统集成、
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,system design, system integration, thermals, electricals, all of that.\N热管理、电气等环节的节奏完美实现这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:15:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a lot of ways, our GPUs, it's a little bit like that HD Hyundai ship and, and what we are hoping for and the reason why we're\N在很多方面，我们的GPU有点像HD现代的那艘船。我们之所以如此紧密地合作，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,partnering so closely together is so that we could build that Vera Rubin in the future as a digital twin,\N正是希望未来能够打造一个Vera Rubin数字孪生体，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:17.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,the entire system as a digital twin, not just the chips, but the systems, the chips,\N将整个系统都变成一个数字孪生，而不仅仅是芯片本身，还包括系统、芯片以及所有组件的整合，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,everything together, cooling thermals and run the thermal simulation directly through it as it is a digital twin.\N连同散热和热力学特性，都能直接通过这个数字孪生体进行热仿真。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's our that's our vision.\N这就是我们的愿景。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we're accelerating the first part of our project together.\N因此，我们正在加速推进我们合作项目的第一个部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership is to accelerate with Siemens EDA, Siemens Simcenter accelerate everything we can with GPUs.\N我们的合作旨在借助西门子EDA和西门子Simcenter，\N充分发挥GPU的加速能力，全面加速各项业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:43.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this way we could scale up the simulations that we do and achieve the\N这样我们就能扩大模拟规模，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,virtual digital twin that we hope for.\N实现我们所期望的虚拟数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,So and, what are we going to do is we will use, your CUDA software to,\N我们将使用你的 CUDA 软件，重写我们的 EDA 软件，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will rewrite our EDA software so it can take advantage of GPUs.\N使其能够充分利用 GPU 的性能。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,So working with GPUs and designing GPUs.\N所以是与GPU协作并设计GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Imagine EDA software being 100 times faster.\N想象一下，电子设计自动化软件的运行速度能快100倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Being able to scale up a million times more.\N实现百万倍的规模扩展。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. That's our that's our hope and dreams.\N对，这就是我们的希望和梦想。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we don't stop there.\N但我们不会止步于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still, we talk about AI, native chip design, what we want to do it now.\N尽管如此，我们仍在讨论AI 原生芯片设计，以及我们现在想做的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:18.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to train our our technology, our models on a massive amount of data so that it's not only about\N我们希望用海量数据来训练我们的技术与模型，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,validation of design, but really making a proposal of new designs and idea.\N使其不仅用于设计验证，更能真正提出全新的设计与创意。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is right through all of the things that was never done before.\N这正是贯穿了所有前所未有的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what we are we are aiming for.\N这就是我们正在努力的目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal of an engineer is not to write Verilog.\N工程师的目标不是编写 Verilog。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not the goal of the engineer.\N那不是工程师的目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal of an engineer, of course, is to solve problems.\N工程师的使命，当然就是解决问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Imagine great solutions.\N想象伟大的解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it would be.\N那将会是。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would be incredible.\N那将令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,One day there would be agentic Siemens EDA designers that are sitting with our designers.\N有一天，将会出现由智能体驱动的西门子EDA设计人员，与我们的设计人员并肩工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're exploring ideas together, trying iterations and exploring boundaries.\N他们正在共同探索各种想法，尝试不同的方案，不断突破边界。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two, we talk about same thing here, AI native simulation.\N第二点，我们在这里讨论的也是同样的事情，即原生AI仿真。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So when it comes to simulation, obviously this is a lot of number crunching.\N所以说到仿真，显然这需要大量的数值计算。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's very often still runs on CPUs.\N而且它通常仍然运行在 CPU 上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first step.\N这是第一步。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to bring this technology, the heavy number crunching elements of our simulation to GPUs.\N我们希望将这项技术，以及我们模拟中的大量数值计算任务，迁移到GPU上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,That again accelerates X times hundred times a thousand times.\N这再次将速度提升了X倍、一百倍、一千倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you can I mean, there's an example.\N如果你能做到的话，举个例子来说。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a cost simulation, by the way.\N顺便说一下，这是一个成本模拟。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It goes back to to when we started off our partners, it was from BMW.\N这要追溯到我们最初与合作伙伴开始的时候，那时是宝马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That we simulate the airflow, the aerodynamics.\N我们模拟气流和空气动力学。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's a lot of, consumption of and it takes a lot of time.\N而且消耗很大，耗时很长。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if you speed it up a thousand times, you can do much, much more iterations.\N所以如果你把它加速一千倍，就能进行多得多的迭代。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, we do not stop there.\N再次强调，我们不会止步于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to have simulation not only to validate but to create.\N我们希望利用仿真，不仅用于验证，更用于创造。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right. Again, you need a lot of data.\N没错，再次强调，你需要大量数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need our technologies.\N你们需要我们的技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's where Nvidia has...\N这就是英伟达所处的位置……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is our technology running in real time.\N这是我们的技术在实时运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our technology together isn't it?\N我们的技术合在一起，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, simulations. Physics is beautiful.\N你知道，模拟仿真。物理真是美妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's just the bottom line.\N这就是最根本的现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Numbers are beautiful.\N数字很美。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We do then.\N我们确实这么做了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only an engineer would say the numbers are just so beautiful.\N只有工程师才会说这些数字美得恰到好处。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we do that for trains.\N我们也是这样为火车做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:20.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and again we will be using physics enabled from Nvidia and the full Siemens simulation stack,\N此外，我们将继续使用英伟达提供的物理引擎以及完整的西门子仿真套件，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,with ours, Siemens has has the world's leading suite for, for industrial simulations and,\N西门子拥有全球领先的工业仿真解决方案，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and simcenter and all of the suites of, of, of, of, solvers in Simcenter.\N包括 Simcenter 及其所有求解器套件。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to accelerate completely using CUDA and CUDA X .\N我们将完全借助 CUDA 和 CUDA X 实现加速。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:44.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are also going to work together to create AI physics, to teach AI the laws of physics so that it could\N我们还将携手合作，开发 AI 物理，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,emulate physics, not to simulate physics from first principles,\N让 AI 学习物理定律，以便模拟物理结果，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:55.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but emulate the outcome of physics, essentially guessing where the physical properties are going to go at\N而不是从第一性原理逐帧仿真——本质上是在猜测物理属性在下一纳秒、
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the next nanosecond, the next microsecond, the next second.\N下一微秒乃至下一秒会如何变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by doing so, we could speed up physics simulations, physics, experimentations, if you will,\N通过这样做，我们可以将物理仿真、物理实验的速度提升一万倍甚至十万倍，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,10,000 times, 100,000 times, and essentially create a real life digital twin of a, wind tunnel.\N从而真正创建出一个风洞的数字孪生体。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We essentially put a real design into it, right?\N我们实际上把它变成了一个真实的设计，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Real digital twin design into a digital twin of a wind tunnel and see it work.\N将真实的风洞设计转化为数字孪生，并观察其运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the the opportunity to do all of these experimentation in real time is really exciting.\N因此，能够实时进行所有这些实验，机会非常令人兴奋。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which brings me talking about physics, the real world, physical AI.\N这让我想到物理学，想到现实世界，想到物理 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:42.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to the third area, step up, which is AI driven adaptive manufacturing.\N这让我谈到第三个领域，即由人工智能驱动的自适应制造。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So and this always reminds me when we talk about our technology stack,\N所以，每次我们谈论技术栈时，总会让我想起你常说的话，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,what we want to bring to the plans was reminds me what you always say.\N这正是我们希望为计划带来的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, actually applying this is almost like a robot, isn't it?\N我的意思是，真正应用起来，几乎就像个机器人，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a big robot. So cycling or a car, you know,\N这是一台大型机器人。无论是骑自行车还是开车，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you look at look at a car today, it's it's, sensors connected to a computer.\N你看现在的汽车，都是传感器连接到电脑。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computer is running software.\N计算机正在运行软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Software defined.\N软件定义。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today the software that we run on top of it is largely AI.\N而如今，运行在它之上的软件在很大程度上都是人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that car is going to be made inside a factory that has sensors running computers,\N那辆车将在一个工厂里制造，工厂内布满传感器，运行着计算机、
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens software, stock and operating systems, and all the AI that you'll have running on top of\N西门子软件、库存和操作系统，以及你将在其上运行的各类人工智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that in a lot of ways, that factory the car isn't inside out.\N在很多方面，这个工厂才是真正的核心，车只是其中的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI the factory is an outside in AI, and it's going to look at,\NAI 工厂是一种从外到内的 AI，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cars that it's going to build and it's going to build it robotically.\N它将审视即将制造的汽车，并以机器人方式完成制造。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the entire factory is going to be one giant robot.\N整个工厂将变成一台巨大的机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to orchestrate a whole bunch of robots that themselves are robotic,\N它将协调大量本身也是机器人的机器人，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and they're going to make products like cars that are software defined in robots.\N它们将制造出像汽车这样由软件定义的机器人产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:21:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's going to be robots orchestrating robots, building robots, you know, in the future.\N所以未来将是机器人指挥机器人，建造机器人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this, this level of integration of technology has never been achieved before.\N因此，这种技术整合程度是前所未有的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's really the reason why we have to build the foundation of future manufacturing from the ground up.\N因此，我们必须从零开始，打造未来制造的基础。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And nobody could do a better than Siemens because you're already the operating system of\N没有人能比西门子做得更好了，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,manufacturing plants all over the world.\N因为你们已经是全球制造工厂的操作系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:25.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so from that baseline, we're going to number one, make it software defined and then to make it AI driven and\N因此，从这个基础出发，我们将首先实现软件定义，然后转向AI驱动，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,all of that, you know, it's so great to see see you drive that vision.\N所有这些都令人非常振奋，看到你推动这一愿景的实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for Siemens to to really make that possible for the world.\N而让西门子真正让这一切成为可能，造福世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we want to use it ourselves. Exactly. Exactly.\N我们自己也要用上它。没错，完全正确。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to start, in Germany in 2026, a first fully AI driven adaptive manufacturing site.\N我们将于2026年在德国启动首个完全由AI驱动的自适应制造基地。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:49.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,We bring an AI brain on top of our software defined automation and our operations software,\N我们在软件定义自动化和运营软件之上，融入了AI大脑，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,which basically consumes that what a digital twin produces when it comes to beauty.\N从而能够处理数字孪生在美学方面所产生的全部输出。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We do that in real time.\N我们实时完成这项操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:21:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right. In real time.\N没错，实时的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can really control the manufacturing.\N因此，你完全可以掌控制造过程。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So our partnership we work together and run Siemens factories.\N因此，我们的合作是共同运营西门子的工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, we have our partner Foxconn working with us,\N与此同时，我们的合作伙伴富士康正与美国合作，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.58,0:22:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,United States to run the factories for building AI supercomputers.\N负责运营工厂，制造AI超级计算机。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this this partnership is really incredible.\N因此，这项合作真的非常了不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've talked about design. We talked about simulation.\N我们谈到了设计，也谈到了仿真。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:22.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking about manufacturing all powered by GPUs,\N现在我们谈论的是全部由 GPU 驱动的制造，全部由 CUDA 驱动，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,all powered by CUDA, all powered by Siemens, and, you know, all powered by AI.\N全部由西门子驱动，当然，也全部由 AI 驱动。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,To see an example of how Foxconn is using the technology already.\N看看富士康如今如何应用这项技术的实例。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:38.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And again, the AI layer on top, the AI brain which connects to the real world data and\N而且再次强调，顶层的AI层，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,real time data makes and it looks so real.\N也就是连接现实世界数据和实时数据的AI大脑，让这一切看起来如此真实。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, this is a digital twin. It's a digital twin.\N但你知道，这是一个数字孪生。这是一个数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.72,0:22:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This looks so incredibly real.\N这看起来真实得令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's that's really the whole purpose of the digital twin.\N这正是数字孪生的真正目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has to it has to in every physically important way and operationally important way.\N它在每一个物理上重要的方面以及操作上重要的方面都必须如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:23:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has to be a perfect representation. And so, the ideal is that the digital twin and the real version of it — there\N它必须是完美的呈现。因此，理想状态是，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.76,0:23:07.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,is no ability for the computer to know the difference,\N数字孪生体与其真实版本之间，计算机无法分辨出任何差别——我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the extent that our AIs can't tell whether they're inside the digital twin or inside the physical world.\NAI 甚至分不清自己是在数字孪生里，还是在现实世界中。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.52,0:23:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's our goal. Exactly. Yeah.\N这就是我们的目标。没错。对。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.56,0:23:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are other factories too.\N还有其他的工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,They produce intelligence.\N他们制造智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,We call it AI factories.\N我们称之为AI工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's the next area of collaboration.\N这就是下一个合作领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I know that when you talk about Vera Rubin, you need obviously new AI factories.\N而且我知道，当你们谈到Vera Rubin时，显然需要新建AI工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have to be designed differently and you're building one on your own, as we speak,\N它们需要以不同的方式设计，而你们现在正在自行搭建一个，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:42.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, so we might want to share about the challenges with what needs to be different.\N所以或许我们可以分享一下，哪些地方需要有所不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:49.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, if you take a look at look at the, the the reason why I don't call it a data center,\N好吧，如果你看看，我之所以不称它为数据中心，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.42,0:23:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,a data center is, a place where, where people store data, these, these plants,\N是因为数据中心是人们存放数据的地方。而这些工厂，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:24:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the case of a one gigawatt data center or one gigawatt factory, it's $50 billion.\N以1吉瓦的数据中心或1吉瓦的工厂为例，成本高达500亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The investment level is unheard of of any type of factory.\N投资规模之高，前所未有，任何类型的工厂都未曾有过。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ever, ever.\N永远，永远。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.20,0:24:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world's ever built the amount of technology and size is incredible.\N人类历史上建造的技术规模和数量都令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if you're building something that costs $50 billion,\N所以如果你在建造一个耗资500亿美元的项目，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,you want to make sure there is absolutely zero scheduled delay.\N你必须确保绝对没有计划内的延迟。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not going to be able to tolerate design changes.\N你无法容忍设计上的改动。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.28,0:24:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to make sure that we create the digital twin.\N你得确保我们创建出数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We plan it upfront.\N我们提前规划好。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We simulate everything upfront.\N我们提前模拟一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.44,0:24:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're pushing the the power.\N我们正在提升算力。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.92,0:24:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're pushing electricity.\N我们正在推动电力发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're we're going to push cooling all the way to the limit.\N我们将把冷却技术推向极限。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:40.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we don't simulate this entire digital, this factory in a digital twin, we have no chance of success.\N所以我们不会去模拟整个数字化的工厂，也就是数字孪生工厂，否则我们根本不可能成功。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then, of course, once you operate it, managing, all of these computers, these AI supercomputers,\N然后，当然，一旦开始运行，就需要管理所有这些计算机、
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.38,0:24:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,the networking, the storage and running it all at the precision, we need to run it at.\NAI 超级计算机、网络、存储，并以所需的精度运行它们。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.52,0:24:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The control of it is incredible.\N它的控制力令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you're controlling, of course, the management of the systems.\N所以你当然在控制系统的管理。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:25:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're controlling the power. You're controlling the cooling.\N你掌控着电力，你掌控着冷却。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.00,0:25:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this entire system is essentially one giant factory, and it's running all the time.\N整个系统本质上就是一个巨大的工厂，而且一直在持续运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so when you put that much, it puts that much capital at work.\N因此，投入这么多资金，就能让这么多资本投入运作。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.76,0:25:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You better make sure that the uptime is perfect and always.\N你得确保系统运行时间始终完美无瑕。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then you're going to make sure that that your scheduled delay is basically zero.\N然后你要确保你的计划延迟基本为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.76,0:25:23.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and without us working together and building these together in a digital twin,\N而且，如果我们不携手合作，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.58,0:25:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the chance of success is extremely low.\N共同构建这种数字孪生，成功的可能性将极低。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Yeah. We can build them faster.\N没错，我们能更快地建造它们。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no different.\N这没什么不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.20,0:25:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, Roland, this is no different than NVIDIA today.\N博乐仁，这跟今天的英伟达没什么两样。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The idea that we would design chips without software is completely illogical, right?\N我们居然会设计没有软件的芯片，这种想法完全不合逻辑，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.88,0:25:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The idea that you would design these electronic systems without design software and\N设想在没有设计软件和验证软件的情况下，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,verification software in simulation.\N通过仿真来设计这些电子系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So come on, forget it.\N别说了，算了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:50.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so the the in the future the idea that we would build plants, manufacturing plants,\N因此，在未来，我们建造工厂——无论是汽车工厂、
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,whether it's a car plant or a chip plant or an AI factory plant,\N芯片工厂还是AI工厂——在没有先通过数字孪生进行模拟的情况下就直接建设，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:26:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,the idea that we would build any of them without first doing it in the digital twin is completely inconceivable.\N这种想法完全不可想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:06.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the idea that we would be able to operate these incredibly complex systems without\N我们能够操作这些极其复杂的系统，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.74,0:26:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,artificial intelligence completely inconceivable.\N却完全不依赖人工智能，这种想法根本是不可想象的。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, so I think that we know that future is here, and we know that the stakes are incredibly high,\N所以，我认为未来已经到来，我们深知其重要性，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.52,0:26:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that's the reason why our partnership with Siemens is so important to me.\N而这也正是我为何认为与西门子的合作如此关键的原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.16,0:26:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We built this, blueprint designs for our factories.\N我们打造了这个，为我们的工厂设计了蓝图。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together.\N携手同行。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.28,0:26:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have automation technology, which is much faster.\N我们拥有自动化技术，速度要快得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:31.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's industrial automation technology because the demand pattern of AI factories is so fluctuating,\N这是工业自动化技术，因为AI工厂的需求模式波动极大，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.86,0:26:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,we know how to connect them to grids because we know how to operate grids.\N而我们深知如何将它们连接到电网，也了解电网的运行方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, you've been doing it for 175 years.\N但你知道，你们已经做了175年了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. We do that.\N没错，我们就是这样做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.44,0:26:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know how to do it After 175 years you’re going to get good at something.\N我们知道该怎么做，175年下来，你自然就精通了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, and what we also do for more than 175 years using our own technology.\N此外，我们还利用自有技术，持续了175多年。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.\N没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, which is the last area we want, I mean actually the people said,\N你知道，这恰恰是我们最不希望出现的领域，事实上，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.64,0:26:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't use the saying we drink our own champagne.\N大家早就说了，别再搞什么自饮香槟的把戏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:27:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now we modify them to drink our own beer or whatever.\N现在我们把它们改造成喝我们自己啤酒的样子，或者其他什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right. German company.\N没错，是一家德国公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we actually we, we use each other technologies, we look deeper into it.\N但实际上，我们互相使用对方的技术，我们进行了更深入的探究。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What can we do more and better.\N我们还能做些什么，做得更好。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it starts, for example, with the plan in Germany.\N它始于德国的计划，例如。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was talking about it's talk.\N我刚才说的是，它在说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:17.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about EDA software simulation and bringing that to the next level to speed\N我们讨论EDA软件仿真，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,up our, each other's development.\N将其提升到新水平，以加速彼此的开发进程。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.\N太不可思议了。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to we're going to work together to accelerate all of your EDA software,\N我们将携手合作，加速你们所有的EDA软件，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,which we can then use to design our chips faster so that we could accelerate your EDA software faster.\N这样我们就能更快地设计芯片，从而进一步加速你们的EDA软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.40,0:27:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to we're going to we're going to use we're going to accelerate all of your Simcenter software\N我们将加速所有 Simcenter 软件，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.99,0:27:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that we could use it to design and simulate our our AI factories faster,\N以便更快地设计和模拟我们的 AI 工厂，从而创造出能加速 AI、
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that we could create AIs that makes AI, makes simcenter faster.\N让 Simcenter 更快的 AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and if you look at this and we're going to we're going to, we're going to use,\N而且如果你看看这个，我们将使用西门子，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.47,0:27:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens so that we could automate our factories to build, even more amazing supercomputers so that we could\N来实现工厂自动化，制造出更强大的超级计算机，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,create AIs to make your AI factories even more productive.\N从而创造出AI，让你们的AI工厂变得更加高效。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that sound like the perfect partnership of two companies coming together?\N这难道不正是两家公司强强联手的完美结合吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And that's why that's why whenever Roland reaches out and he needs a bug fix, I fix it right away.\N对，所以每当博乐仁联系我，需要修复某个漏洞时，我都会立刻处理。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because I fix his bug, which directly comes back to my company, my engineers go faster.\N因为我修复了他的漏洞，这直接反馈到我的公司，我的工程师们就能更快地推进。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.24,0:28:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I tell you this works both ways.\N我告诉你们，这双向都有效。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that’s, You have a call. So Jensen.\N所以，你接到一个电话了。黄仁勋。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for the partnership. Thank you, The best is ahead of us.\N非常感谢这次合作，感谢您，最好的还在前方。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a, we are at the beginning of a new industrial revolution and and what what perfect company for all of that capability\N这是一场全新的工业革命的开端，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,to come together than the company at the center of every industrial revolution.\N而将所有这些能力汇聚在一起的完美公司，正是每一场工业革命的核心所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's a great privilege to partner with Siemens.\N因此，能与西门子合作是一大荣幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's incredible to be friends with you and and to see your, your vision of Siemens come together and,\N能与你成为朋友，亲眼见证西门子的愿景一步步实现，对我们而言，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,for our journey of, you know, reinventing industry, to, achieve this milestone is incredible.\N重新定义工业的这段旅程能达成这一里程碑，实在令人难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.64,0:29:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So thank you.\N谢谢大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:18.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens and Nvidia operating the industrial production system Well. When I last spoke at CES,\N西门子和英伟达正在运营工业生产系统。上次我在CES上发言时，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.45,0:29:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shared a vision of the industrial metaverse, a vision for a virtual world that helps us make the real world better.\N曾分享过一个工业元宇宙的愿景，那就是一个虚拟世界，帮助我们让现实世界变得更好。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we are making this vision a reality.\N今天，我们正将这一愿景变为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are excited to launch our Digital Twin Composer.\N我们很高兴推出我们的数字孪生组合器。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,With a Digital Twin Composer, you can create a virtual 3D model of any product, any plant,\N通过数字孪生组合器，你可以创建任何产品、
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.64,0:29:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,any process, bring it to life in a photorealistic scene that you built and in real time.\N任何工厂或任何流程的虚拟三维模型，并将其置于你构建的逼真场景中，实时呈现。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.88,0:30:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Digital Twin Composer is so powerful because you can connect the digital twin to the real world and to real time data,\N数字孪生组合器之所以强大，是因为你可以将数字孪生与现实世界和实时数据连接起来，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,from engineering data to weather data, even time series data coming from your machines.\N从工程数据、天气数据，到机器传来的时序数据都能接入。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.16,0:30:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when something worked well or something went wrong, you can go back in time and you find out why.\N当某件事进展顺利或出现问题时，你都可以回溯时间，找出原因。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.40,0:30:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you can jump to the future to simulate the scenario before you build it in the real world.\N你也可以跳转到未来，先在现实中建造之前模拟该场景。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.96,0:30:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you want to unlock the full benefits of the Digital Twin Composer,\N如果你想充分发挥数字孪生组合器的全部优势，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.88,0:30:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you connect it to our operations software and our hardware stack.\N只需将其连接到我们的运营软件和硬件栈即可。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That when you can make real world changes from the virtual environment, optimize machine speed,\N当你能够从虚拟环境中实现真实世界的改变，优化机器速度、
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,temperature, pressure, or any parameter that determines the quality in the yield of your plant.\N温度、压力或任何影响工厂产出质量的参数时。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.16,0:30:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how we combine the real and the digital worlds.\N这就是我们融合现实世界与数字世界的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.28,0:31:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Digital Twin Composer will be available on our Siemens Xcelerator marketplace in just a few moments.\N这款数字孪生组合器将在片刻之后上线西门子 Xcelerator 市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.16,0:31:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,PepsiCo PepsiCo is among the first companies to use it.\N百事公司是首批使用该技术的公司之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this brings me to our next guest who is leading the way when it comes to the digitalization of PepsiCo,\N这让我想到下一位嘉宾，他正在引领百事公司数字化转型，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.12,0:31:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,making the company smarter, more efficient, more sustainable with industrial AI.\N通过工业AI让公司变得更智能、更高效、更可持续。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Athina Kanioura.\N欢迎阿西娜·卡尼乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.76,0:31:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a great year.\N这是个好年头。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your year, great year!\N你的这一年，太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.80,0:31:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is, it is. Yeah.\N是的，确实是。没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.60,0:31:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell us about the challenge PepsiCo's is navigating through.\N那么请跟我们说说百事公司正在应对的挑战是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.96,0:32:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these challenges are very much alike to both the whole food and beverage industry.\N这些挑战与整个食品饮料行业面临的困境非常相似。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah of course.\N当然了。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:11.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as Roland said I'm very privileged to be on stage with Roland and, you know,\N正如博乐仁所说，能与博乐仁同台，我感到非常荣幸，而且众所周知，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,PepsiCo has been pioneering some of these innovation with you and Nvidia.\N百事公司一直与英伟达携手，在这些创新领域走在前列。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.92,0:32:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,So but from farm to shelf, PepsiCo, has been operating in a very extraordinary and very complex\N但从农场到货架，百事公司一直在一个非常特殊且极其复杂的环境中运营，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,environment because we have operations everywhere.\N因为我们遍布全球都有业务。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We serve billions of consumers.\N我们服务数十亿消费者。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.60,0:32:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have billions of touch points per day.\N我们每天有数十亿个触点。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.84,0:32:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So consumers expect the products to be everywhere every time.\N因此，消费者期望产品随时随地都能买到。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.68,0:32:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In real time.\N实时。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we want to be able to fulfill the supply.\N我们希望能够满足供应需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So imagine a world where you have demand spikes, where you have unusual events.\N想象一个需求突然激增、出现异常事件的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.68,0:32:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you have tornadoes, you have to be able to fulfill this demand in a very digital way,\N面对龙卷风时，你必须以非常数字化的方式满足这种需求，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,where the physical footprint cannot be a showstopper.\N物理空间的限制不能成为阻碍。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. So a ton of a supply chain and delivering.\N对，供应链和交付方面压力很大。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at your existing warehouses.\N我们来看一下你现有的仓库。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.20,0:33:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So I mean, many of you know, especially the ones that come from the manufacturing world,\N是的。我想你们很多人，尤其是来自制造行业的人，都知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have great warehouses that are fully modernized, but we also have warehouses that are very old.\N我们拥有非常现代化的仓库，但也有一些仓库非常老旧。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.88,0:33:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So in this specific case, this warehouse is half a century old.\N在这种特定情况下，这个仓库已有五十年历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that means in the current state, it really cannot serve and deliver the demand.\N这意味着在当前状态下，它确实无法满足并应对需求。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That might change depending on the events.\N这可能会根据事件的发展而改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what is the answer?\N那么答案到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the answer cannot.\N答案无法给出。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,These cannot be I will just build more capacity.\N这些我无法解决，我只会再建更多产能。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The answer must be I need to find a way to maximize the capacity that I have to drive more\N答案必须是，我需要找到一种方法，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,operational efficiency and therefore increase the throughput.\N最大化我现有的产能，以提升运营效率，从而增加吞吐量。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.44,0:33:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what we wanted to do is adopt a digital first design approach, and that means to leverage the digital twins and\N我们想要采取的是以数字为先的设计方法，这意味着要充分利用数字孪生技术，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,adopting AI at scale in all the parts of the operations where we were able to co-design and\N并在所有能够实现协同设计、仿真和优化布局的运营环节中大规模应用人工智能，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulate and optimize the layout before any physical building begins.\N确保在任何实体建筑动工之前就完成布局的优化。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So and to do that, you decided to use our Digital Twin Composer.\N为此，你们决定使用我们的数字孪生组合器。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Share your experience. Yes.\N分享你的经历。对。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, thank you.\N首先，非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership.\N感谢合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.44,0:34:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the investment.\N感谢您的投资。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.64,0:34:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking our feedback into product innovation.\N感谢你们将我们的反馈融入产品创新。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we just had a press release. Yes.\N今天我们就发布了一则新闻稿。没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are very excited to help save this technology in partnership with Nvidia.\N我们非常激动，能够与英伟达携手，共同拯救这项技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.60,0:34:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, Siemens this is the first of its kind for the industry.\N当然，西门子这是行业内的首次。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.84,0:34:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is how we build AI and digital twins into our operations across the board globally.\N这是我们全球范围内将人工智能和数字孪生融入各项运营的方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:42.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,When we say operations, that is manufacturing, warehousing,\N当我们提到运营时，指的是制造、仓储、
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.54,0:34:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,distribution centers, mixing centers and every part of logistics.\N配送中心、混合中心以及物流的每一个环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:52.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the Digital Twin Composer allows us to do everything in the virtual world,\N数字孪生组合器让我们能够在虚拟世界中完成所有工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.30,0:34:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,being able to simulate everything in a way where we don't have to spend a single dollar on the\N以一种无需在确认设计为最终方案前，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,physical plant before we know that design is the final design.\N就对实体工厂投入任何资金的方式进行全方位模拟。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So therefore we are able to pull now massive amounts of data that we are able to\N因此，我们现在能够获取海量数据，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulate in a unified, immersive environment.\N并在统一、沉浸式的环境中进行模拟。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means we can create a beautiful, photorealistic way, which you saw before in the discussion.\N这意味着我们可以创造出一种美丽且高度逼真的方式，正如我们之前讨论中看到的那样。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with the AI powered simulation.\N借助AI驱动的仿真。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we can explore hundreds or thousands of potential layouts to find the most efficient options.\N现在我们可以探索数百甚至数千种潜在布局，以找到最高效的方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, with a digital twin, this type of task that would have normally taken months now takes days.\N因此，借助数字孪生，原本需要数月完成的这类任务，现在只需几天即可完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.32,0:35:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, and the question would be then what does that do to your customers?\N那么问题来了，这会对你的客户产生什么影响？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well obviously for us, making sure we serve our customers in the most efficient way where we provide the inventory\N是的。对我们而言，以最高效的方式服务客户至关重要，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:51.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we have the intelligent network where both the plants,\N这意味着我们要提供充足的库存，并构建一个智能网络，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the warehouses and the network is able to anticipate the demand and fine tune operations in real time is a must.\N使工厂、仓库和整个网络能够实时预测需求并优化运营。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.16,0:36:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So therefore, we have had significant impact even in the first three months.\N因此，我们在前三个月就已产生了显著影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.72,0:36:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So one good example is in the Gatorade plant in the US we use the Digital Twin Composer.\N一个很好的例子是，我们在美国的佳得乐工厂使用了数字孪生组合器。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were able to drive two very meaningful results.\N我们成功实现了两个非常有意义的成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:16.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is to increase efficiency 20% just in three months.\N仅用三个月时间，效率就能提升20%。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And obviously if we were to look at we have estimated how this capabilities will benefit the company.\N显然，如果我们来评估一下，这些能力将如何惠及公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,We estimate the CapEx reduction of 10 to 15% across all the operations.\N我们预计所有运营环节的资本支出将减少10%到15%。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So for us, this is just the beginning.\N对我们而言，这仅仅是个开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.72,0:36:33.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are very hopeful about what this technology can do when it comes to serving our\N我们对这项技术在服务客户和消费者
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.11,0:36:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,customers, serving our consumers.\N方面所能实现的潜力充满希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.88,0:36:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would really to thank you for the great partnership.\N非常感谢你们的卓越合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.36,0:36:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership.\N感谢合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.72,0:36:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, this is just the start.\N而且，这还只是开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to see more and we will see more. Athina, Thank you very much. Thank you so much. Thank you.\N我们还想看到更多，而且未来会看到更多。阿西娜，非常感谢，真的非常感谢，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have seen the great impacts that the Digital Twin Composer is having on PepsiCo facilities.\N你已经看到了数字孪生组合器对百事公司设施产生的巨大影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using this technology, even in the design phase of new plants matters,\N利用这项技术，即使在新工厂的设计阶段也至关重要，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:10.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,especially in the United States, because it accelerates the ramp up of new manufacturing sites and allows our\N尤其是在美国，因为它能加速新制造基地的投产进程，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.65,0:37:14.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,customers to make them more productive and energy efficient.\N帮助客户提升生产效率和能源利用效率。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.52,0:37:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,KION uses our technology to transform warehouses entire supply chains too.\N凯傲利用我们的技术，将整个供应链都进行了改造。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.\N我们来看一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.24,0:37:29.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,KION the supply chain solutions company is scaling up physical AI and automation solutions to orchestrate customer supply\N凯傲这家供应链解决方案公司正在扩大物理 AI 与自动化解决方案的规模，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:35.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,chains inside the four walls and up and down the supply chain with AI, digital twins,\N利用 AI 和数字孪生技术，实现对客户供应链的全面协调，覆盖企业内部及整个供应链上下游。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.26,0:37:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,a new supply chain solution begins as a digital twin compressing solutioning from years to months.\N一项全新的供应链解决方案从数字孪生压缩方案开始，将原本需要数年的解决方案周期缩短至数月。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can learn more about the Digital Composer at our booth.\N您可以在我们的展位了解更多关于数字孪生组合器的信息。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also on this CES show floor when you will meet the team from PAVE 360.\N此外，在本届CES展台上，您还将见到PAVE 360团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.52,0:38:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,PAVE 360 automotive is our digital twin for autonomous driving system,\NPAVE 360 汽车是我们的自动驾驶系统数字孪生，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it's ready to use right off the shelf.\N开箱即用。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It replicates real vehicle hardware in the digital world.\N它在数字世界中复现了真实车辆的硬件。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developers can simulate real world driving conditions.\N开发者可以模拟真实的驾驶环境。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can test the autonomous system before a car even exists, and this accelerates the development.\N它们可以在汽车实际存在之前就测试自动驾驶系统，从而加速研发进程。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.36,0:38:31.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,PAVE 360 automotive also replicates how the software in the car behaves,\NPAVE 360 汽车平台还能模拟汽车软件的实际运行情况，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.81,0:38:41.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,and better yet, it integrates the latest automotive IP from our partner ARM for advanced driver assistance\N更棒的是，它集成了我们合作伙伴 ARM 最新的汽车知识产权，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,systems, infotainment and the AI driven cockpit features.\N涵盖高级驾驶辅助系统、信息娱乐系统以及由 AI 驱动的座舱功能。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a solution that will scale autonomous driving faster with the power of industrial AI.\N这是一项将借助工业AI的力量，更快地推动自动驾驶规模化发展的解决方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.88,0:39:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now imagine what happens when we apply industrial AI to something more personal, even more complex.\N现在想象一下，当我们将工业AI应用于更个人化、甚至更复杂的领域时，会发生什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your body, your health.\N你的身体，你的健康。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.44,0:39:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life sciences.\N生命科学
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bringing new medicines to the market costs a lot of time and money.\N将新药推向市场需要耗费大量时间和金钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.12,0:39:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the last 50 years, these costs have risen dramatically.\N在过去50年里，这些成本大幅上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.84,0:39:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It often takes more than ten years and costs are up to $2 billion.\N通常需要十多年时间，成本高达20亿美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.60,0:39:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patients and pharmaceutical companies obviously want to have faster innovations.\N患者和制药公司显然都希望实现更快的创新。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.56,0:39:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means tackling every step in the chain from early research to manufacturing.\N这意味着要解决从早期研究到制造的整个链条中的每一个环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we bring AI to all these steps.\N我们将人工智能融入所有这些环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.48,0:39:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take the example of a new cancer drug.\N我们以一种新抗癌药物为例。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,In research lab scientists create billions of data points.\N在科研实验室中，科学家们生成了数十亿个数据点。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.36,0:40:00.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, this data is scattered across industries and instruments and files and around the world\N如今，这些数据分散在各个行业、仪器、文件中，遍布全球。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:06.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,through our platform, Luma scientists use AI to bring this data together and\N通过我们的平台，Luma 的科学家们利用人工智能将这些数据汇聚并结构化，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.54,0:40:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,structure it so you can ask questions in natural language.\N让您能够用自然语言提出问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next step, scientists identify the most promising molecular structure of the cancer drug with AI powered\N下一步，科学家利用AI驱动的模拟技术，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulations that can simulate the behavior of the molecule.\N识别出抗癌药物最具潜力的分子结构，这些模拟能够预测分子的行为。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,2.5 million times more efficiently than ever before.\N比以往高效了250万倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this includes how molecules move and flex, how they interact with each other, or how stable they are.\N这包括分子如何运动和变形，它们之间如何相互作用，以及它们的稳定性如何。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over time.\N随着时间推移。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.08,0:40:50.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then, when you need to go from making a small batch in the lab to producing at scale without the\N但当你需要从实验室小批量生产，转向大规模生产，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.05,0:40:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,slightest deviation in the recipe, and with exactly the same result,\N且配方一丝不差、结果完全一致时，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.46,0:41:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,even for world class production experts, this means a lot of trial and error.\N即便是世界级的生产专家，也意味着要经历大量试错。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.60,0:41:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,A lot of experiments in a bioreactor, and our digital twin of a bioreactor.\N大量在生物反应器中的实验，以及我们对生物反应器的数字孪生。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.44,0:41:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can run these experiments in the digital world, first.\N你可以在数字世界中先进行这些实验。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You simulate until you have the highest quality and the highest output.\N你不断模拟，直到达到最高质量和最高产出。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And only then and only then you start the production.\N只有到那时，你才开始生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens technology accelerates all steps from discovery to manufacturing.\N西门子技术加速了从发现到制造的每一个环节。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life saving therapies can make it to the market as much as 50% faster,\N救命疗法的上市速度可比以往快达50%，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.70,0:41:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and at every stage, AI speeds things up.\N而且在每个阶段，AI都在加速进程。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.04,0:41:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This requires powerful AI infrastructure too.\N这同样需要强大的AI基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The GPUs used in the AI factories I talked about with Jensen,\N我之前和黄仁勋谈到的AI工厂所使用的GPU，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also the cloud infrastructure we get from partners like Microsoft on that.\N以及我们从微软等合作伙伴那里获得的云基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.20,0:42:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's hear from my friend Satya Nadella.\N让我们听听我的朋友萨蒂亚·纳德拉的看法。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.16,0:42:03.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Roland.\N非常感谢你，博乐仁。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fantastic to join all of you at CES.\N很高兴在CES与大家相聚。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.96,0:42:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the industrial sector we have an incredible opportunity to bring together digital intelligence with physical\N在工业领域，我们有机会将数字智能与实体运营相结合，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,operations, to reinvent things that are designed, built and run in this era of AI.\N重新定义这个人工智能时代中设计、建造和运行的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.76,0:42:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're already seeing the industrial AI drive better outcomes in both productivity as well as in safety.\N我们已经看到，工业AI在提升生产效率和安全性方面取得了更好的成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why our partnership with Siemens is so important to us at Microsoft.\N这就是为什么我们与西门子的合作对微软如此重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.40,0:42:35.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,By combining your deep domain expertise with our trusted cloud and AI capabilities,\N通过将您深厚的行业专长与我们值得信赖的云技术和人工智能能力相结合，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.70,0:42:40.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are helping our customers tackle some of today's most pressing challenges,\N我们正帮助客户应对当今最紧迫的挑战，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.61,0:42:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,from sustainable energy and transportation to smart cities and precision medicine.\N从可持续能源和交通，到智慧城市和精准医疗。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.84,0:42:51.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm especially excited about the core engineering work our teams are driving to build custom models and\N我特别兴奋的是，我们的团队正在推进核心工程工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.90,0:42:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,agents that get trained with real world industrial data.\N构建定制模型和智能体，并利用真实世界的工业数据进行训练。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, we're just getting started.\N当然，我们才刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.52,0:43:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I could not be more optimistic about what we do together and achieve together.\N我对我们的共同事业和共同成就充满无比乐观。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.68,0:43:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so very much.\N非常感谢大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Satya.\N谢谢萨蒂亚。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.92,0:43:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, custom models, agents and of course Copilots.\N因此，定制模型、智能体，当然还有 Copilot。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.68,0:43:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk more about it with Jay Parikh.\N我们来和杰伊·帕里克多聊聊这个话题。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.24,0:43:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi Nice seeing you So Jay, you are leading Microsoft's core AI team.\N嗨，很高兴见到你。杰伊，你负责微软的核心 AI 团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:41.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You put all AI experts together which tells me again this is a foundational technology\N你把所有AI专家聚集在一起，这再次表明，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,with skills across the whole company.\N这是一项基础性技术，其能力贯穿了整个公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.44,0:43:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, where are you in the step of really making this AI, journey creating impact for your customers?\N那么，你目前在真正打造AI、为客户创造价值的旅程中处于哪个阶段？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.88,0:43:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, first of all, thank you for the partnership.\N是的，首先非常感谢你们的合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.36,0:43:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excited about what we're working on today and also going forward.\N对今天正在推进的工作以及未来的展望充满期待。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.44,0:44:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So as what we're seeing today is really three waves with more waves coming in terms of AI,\N我们现在看到的AI发展实际上已经经历了三波，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first wave was really folks using AI as a chat bot, right?\N而且未来还将有更多波次。第一波是人们把AI当作聊天机器人来使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.84,0:44:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ask it simple questions, maybe do code completions.\N问它一些简单的问题，比如进行代码补全。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second wave is much more focused on delegating a specific task to AI,\N第二波则更加专注于将特定任务委派给AI，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.01,0:44:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,may be giving it a task to do and come up with a market strategy, document,\N比如让它完成一项任务，制定市场策略、撰写文件或提出方案，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.11,0:44:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,or proposal to do these longer running, kind of more sophisticated tasks.\N来应对那些持续时间更长、更为复杂的任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what we're seeing emerging in this third wave is this set of agents working with and orchestrating a set of different\N现在，我们看到在第三波浪潮中涌现的，是一组智能体协同运作，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,agents to be able to do asynchronous work, but much more complicated work, right?\N并协调多个不同智能体，实现异步工作，而且能完成更复杂的任务，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.68,0:44:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Longer running tasks.\N更长时间运行的任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.36,0:44:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it is this third wave that we're focused on building because you need multiple models.\N而这第三波正是我们专注打造的方向，因为你需要多个模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.84,0:44:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to train your own models, right?\N你得能训练自己的模型，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.84,0:44:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to bring in your enterprise data.\N你需要能够引入企业数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.24,0:44:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to orchestrate these agents, but you also need to do it with security,\N你需要能够协调这些智能体，同时还要在安全、
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.80,0:45:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,with observability, with compliance with all of that scale, enterprise ready abstractions.\N可观测性以及符合所有这些规模和企业级抽象要求的合规性方面做到位。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.36,0:45:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. And it is this area in this third wave that I'm most excited for us to be working together,\N对。我最期待我们携手共进的，正是这一波浪潮中的这个领域，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.68,0:45:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,because this third wave is how we bring this technology to specific use cases and industries.\N因为第三波浪潮正是我们将这项技术应用于具体场景和行业的关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Roland, I'm really curious is like this third wave, how does this show up as you lead industrials with AI?\N但博乐仁，我很好奇，当你们用AI引领工业领域时，这第三波浪潮具体会以什么形式展现出来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this manifesting with your customers? And, I mean, there are many examples.\N这在您的客户身上是如何体现的呢？我的意思是，这样的例子有很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.96,0:45:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought one, it's just a very exciting one.\N我带了一个，非常令人兴奋的一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.08,0:45:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about Rolls Royce they do turbines for airplanes.\N我们提到劳斯莱斯，他们为飞机制造涡轮发动机。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.44,0:45:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I mean, obviously you want to have these turbines to to work hundred percent reliable.\N而且显然，你希望这些涡轮机能够百分之百可靠地运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.56,0:45:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course fuel efficient.\N当然，燃油效率也很高。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.04,0:45:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And within these turbines they have alot of design parts coming,\N这些涡轮机内部包含大量设计部件，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.10,0:45:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,these are designed with Siemens software and technology from Microsoft.\N均采用西门子软件和微软技术进行设计。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.60,0:45:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there's a particular one which is a hydraulic pump.\N还有一个特殊的，是液压泵。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that makes this machine turning.\N这使得这台机器开始运转。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.04,0:46:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this pump has now a digital twin of the pump itself,\N因此，这个泵现在不仅拥有自身数字化的孪生体，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.17,0:46:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it also is a digital twin of the machines machining it.\N还拥有加工它的机器的数字化孪生体。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we simulate the whole process.\N我们模拟了整个过程。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.32,0:46:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In programing it.\N在编程中。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.44,0:46:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we use your technologies together with ours and simulated with amazing outcomes.\N我们结合使用你们的技术和我们的技术，并通过模拟取得了惊人的成果。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,These pumps are much stiffer and lighter.\N这些泵更坚固且更轻。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.64,0:46:24.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we use Microsoft as well here and AI technologies for.\N但我们这里也使用微软以及人工智能技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.88,0:46:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And excited about the other things that we're working on with these joint AI copilots.\N是的，同时也很期待我们与这些联合AI助手合作的其他项目。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. We're able to help reduce the programing time for can by 80%.\N没错，我们能够帮助将汽车控制程序的开发时间减少80%。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Drove drove up productivity in the factory by 30%.\N工厂的生产效率提升了30%。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then also excited to work with your team to bring the GitHub platform to all of the developers to\N同时也很期待与你们团队合作，将 GitHub 平台带给所有开发者，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.48,0:46:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,drive that innovation, that value for your customers faster.\N加速推动创新，更快地为客户创造价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.00,0:46:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, all built together on Microsoft's cloud and AI.\N同样，这一切都是基于微软的云和人工智能共同构建的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. And there are many more examples.\N没错，还有更多类似的例子。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand is huge.\N需求巨大。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:47:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the benefits of not only shortening the development time, but also the production time is amazing.\N不仅缩短了开发周期，还大幅缩短了生产周期，带来的好处令人惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.12,0:47:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talked about technology, but you cannot stop there.\N我们谈了技术，但你不能止步于此。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.96,0:47:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we know that you're very passionate about also the the other part,\N而且我们知道，你对另一部分——文化层面，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.59,0:47:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cultural, the way how you transform the you have seen the people.\N以及你所看到的人们如何被改变的方式——也充满热情。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.16,0:47:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hard.\N很难。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.64,0:47:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's hard.\N这很难。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know that's the let's talk about it. Yeah.\N我知道，咱们来聊聊吧。对。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.40,0:47:24.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you know, I spent probably last year talking to about 2 or 300 customers.\N所以，你知道，我去年大概花了大量时间跟二三百个客户交流。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.32,0:47:32.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was fascinating because somewhere between probably 70 and 80% of my conversations with customers started or ended or was\N而且这非常有趣，因为在与客户的交流中，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.60,0:47:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,dominated by this topic of change, about culture, about people, about organizations.\N大概70%到80%的对话都围绕着变革展开，无论是文化、人员还是组织。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.08,0:47:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was such an interesting set of conversations.\N而且那是一系列非常有趣的对话。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.88,0:47:45.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my kind of three current takeaways from those conversations were, one is like,\N我从这些对话中总结出三点体会：第一，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.61,0:47:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're all learning together, and we're sharing openly about what's happening in organizations,\N我们都在共同学习，坦诚分享组织内部的情况，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.04,0:47:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,small startups to, you know, companies that are much, much, much bigger multinational.\N从小型初创企业到规模大得多的跨国公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.00,0:48:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this culture of change is something that we have to share openly and work together on.\N因此，这种变革文化需要我们公开分享，并携手共进。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.40,0:48:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second thing that I noticed and comes up in conversations is actually many of the employees.\N我注意到的第二点，也是在交谈中经常提到的，其实是许多员工。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of the workers are using this technology in their personal lives, right?\N很多工人在个人生活中都在使用这项技术，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.52,0:48:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're using it.\N他们正在使用它。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.48,0:48:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're actually really sophisticated with it for family, for personal growth, etc.\N他们在家庭、个人成长等方面实际上运用得非常成熟。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.32,0:48:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,but there are institutional headwinds to adopting it, using it inside the company, whether it be compliance,\N但要将其引入公司内部使用，仍面临诸多体制性阻力，无论是合规、
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.56,0:48:28.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,whether it be risk, whether it be security, whether it be finance, whether it be just misaligned incentives.\N风险、安全，还是财务，亦或是激励机制不一致等问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.80,0:48:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. And then so it is our job to try to work and try to unlock and this value of\N对。因此，我们的任务就是努力去探索、
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.10,0:48:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,this creativity, this collaboration.\N去释放这种创造力和协作所带来的价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.40,0:48:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then third thing that I always encourage folks to do is really the potential intelligence of these models.\N第三点，我总是鼓励大家去关注这些模型所蕴含的潜在智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.88,0:48:48.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The capabilities of the platforms that we're building here at Microsoft are so much\N我们在微软这里构建的平台能力，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.18,0:48:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,more capable than what we realized today.\N远比我们今天所意识到的要强大得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.80,0:48:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So my biggest encouragement to myself, to my teams, to our partners, is to really raise our level of ambition,\N因此，我给自己、给我的团队以及我们的合作伙伴最大的鼓励，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.35,0:49:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,of what we can do with AI to drive the world forward and to deliver more impact.\N就是真正提升我们的雄心，用人工智能推动世界前进，创造更大的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.84,0:49:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I tell you I can say it from my perspective.\N我跟你说，我可以从我的角度来说。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We see a lot of this changes also in working with you, working with our customers, but also with you.\N我们看到，与你们合作、与客户合作的过程中，也发生了许多这样的变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.12,0:49:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You come from a different environment,\N你来自不同的环境，但我们把这些整合起来带给客户，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we bring that together to our customers and they do appreciate it, I tell you.\N他们真的很感激，我跟你说。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for doing that.\N非常感谢你这么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.00,0:49:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, this is just the start. Yes. Thank you.\N而且，这仅仅是个开始。是的，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.64,0:49:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership. Thank you.\N感谢合作，谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.60,0:49:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So more powerful industrial copilots and now new Copilots.\N因此，更强大的工业 Copilot 问世了，现在又推出了全新的 Copilot。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.92,0:49:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today at CES, we are launching nine additional AI powered Siemens Industrial Copilots.\N今天在CES上，我们将推出九款全新的英伟达赋能的西门子工业Copilot。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.32,0:49:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,They bring intelligence along the entire industrial value chain, transforming how we design,\N它们将智能贯穿整个工业价值链，变革我们设计、
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.16,0:49:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,engineer and operate and well to help everyone access this kind of technology more easily.\N工程和运营的方式，同时也让更多人更容易地获取这类技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.84,0:50:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are now putting it in the hands of our Shopfloor colleagues.\N我们现在已将它交到车间同事手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.56,0:50:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or to be more precise, on their faces. Together with META.\N更准确地说，是在他们的脸上。与元宇宙一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.36,0:50:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are making Rayban META glasses for industrial AI.\N我们正在为工业AI打造Ray-Ban Meta智能眼镜。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.68,0:50:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I actually we do not use the tinted ones.\N实际上，我们不用带颜色的那款。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.52,0:50:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine.\N正如你所想象的那样。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe if the sun is shining.\N也许太阳照耀的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.32,0:50:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, there are also, natural ones.\N但也有天然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:31.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, they tell our colleagues to get real time audio guidance through the glasses,\N而且，他们告诉我们的同事，通过眼镜获得实时音频指导，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,which button to press, which parameters to change.\N知道该按哪个按钮，该调整哪些参数。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.56,0:50:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at one of our factories, where these glasses will turn colleagues into connected\N让我们来看看我们的一家工厂——这些眼镜将让同事变成互联的专家，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.68,0:50:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,experts so they can have more impact in the real world.\N从而在现实世界中产生更大影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Handsfree.\N免提操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.44,0:50:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Sarah, I just started working at this factory.\N嗨，我是莎拉，我刚到这家工厂工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Honestly, there's a ton to learn.\N老实说，要学的东西太多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.64,0:50:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's great having AI from Siemens to help me get familiar with everything.\N有西门子的AI帮忙，让我熟悉一切，真是太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good morning Sarah.\N早上好，莎拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.08,0:51:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a quick look at how the last shift went and what's coming up.\N我们快速看一下上一班次的情况以及接下来的安排。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.56,0:51:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, you'll be operating the robotic assembly line.\N今天，你们将操作机器人装配线。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've noticed an issue with some sensors at cell four that could lead to assembly faults later.\N我注意到四号工位的一些传感器存在问题，可能会导致后续装配故障。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.76,0:51:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,A reset now can prevent that.\N现在重启一下，就能避免这种情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.28,0:51:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should I guide you through the process?\N需要我带你过一遍这个流程吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.60,0:51:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I love about my AI is how easy it is to use.\N我最喜欢我的AI的地方，就是它用起来非常简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.20,0:51:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,It brings together live machine data, knowledge from my colleagues and all of our standard operating\N它整合了实时机器数据、同事们的知识以及我们所有的标准操作流程，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.46,0:51:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,procedures, and explains everything in a way that makes sense to me at my pace,\N以一种符合我节奏、我语言的方式，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.20,0:51:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my language, and now select restart with AI from Siemens.\N将一切解释得清晰易懂，现在可选择通过西门子的AI进行重启。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can solve problems efficiently, quickly, confidently.\N我能高效、快速、自信地解决问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.88,0:51:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first test show that colleagues are more confident in their work, and they're also more productive.\N首次测试显示，同事们对自己的工作更加自信，工作效率也更高。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.52,0:51:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's impact in the real world.\N这才是真实世界中的影响力。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.68,0:52:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,By scaling industrial AI.\N通过扩展工业AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.44,0:52:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we're heading for another huge bottleneck power electric power AI factories and\N但我们正面临另一个巨大的瓶颈：电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.51,0:52:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,data require gigawatts of electric power.\NAI 工厂和数据中心需要千兆瓦级别的电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.48,0:52:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what if what if you had an energy source that was clean, safe, affordable, and practically limitless?\N现在，假如你拥有一种清洁、安全、廉价且几乎无限的能源，会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.84,0:52:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the promise of fusion power.\N这就是核聚变能源的承诺。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my next guest.\N这让我想到下一位嘉宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.28,0:52:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commonwealth Fusion Systems is working on the world's first commercially viable machine to make fusion real.\N联邦聚变系统公司正在研发世界上第一台具有商业可行性的核聚变装置，让核聚变真正实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.60,0:52:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Bob Mumgaard.\N欢迎鲍勃·穆姆加德。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.24,0:53:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hi, Bob So, for the starters, what is fusion?\N你好，嗨，鲍勃。那么，首先，核聚变是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.28,0:53:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a good question. So?\N这是个好问题。那么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.72,0:53:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So fusion is the power of the universe.\N所以核聚变是宇宙的能量之源。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.56,0:53:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the stars.\N这是星辰之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.24,0:53:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what we want to do is build machines here on Earth that create that power, that harness it.\N我们想做的，是在地球上建造能够产生并利用这种能源的机器。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.04,0:53:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that would mean that we would go from an energy system that is about natural resource\N这意味着我们将从依赖自然资源消耗的能源体系，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.00,0:53:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumption to an energy system that's about technology.\N转向以技术为核心的能源体系。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.12,0:53:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you build these machines?\N你能制造出这些机器吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.72,0:53:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,How fast can you build them? How well do they run?\N你能多快把它们造出来？它们运行得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we work on a type of machine called a tokamak, basically a bottle that holds a star inside of it.\N我们研究的是一种叫做托卡马克的机器，本质上就是一个能把恒星装在里面的“瓶子”。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.44,0:53:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So these are massive machines.\N这些是巨大的机器。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.40,0:53:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there are for decades researchers, engineers trying to make it.\N几十年来，研究人员和工程师一直在努力实现它。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.76,0:53:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell us why should it work now. Right.\N那说说看，为什么现在它就能奏效了呢？没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.80,0:53:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we're at CES where many of the technologies we see, you know, were ideas even just five years ago.\N所以我们现在在CES，这里展出的许多技术，其实五年前还只是个想法。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.24,0:53:56.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the technical stack that has been developed from simulation tools,\N但通过仿真工具和对物理规律的理解所构建的技术体系，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:54:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the physical understanding, has enabled a lot of these technologies.\N已经推动了这些技术的实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.40,0:54:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And fusion is no different.\N核聚变也是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.92,0:54:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have very large simulations where we understand the underlying physics of the process.\N我们进行了非常大规模的模拟，能够理解该过程背后的物理原理。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.52,0:54:12.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can layer that into manufacturing these machines that are complex,\N我们可以将这项技术应用于制造这些结构复杂、
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.45,0:54:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that perform these very delicate procedures.\N能执行精细操作的机器。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can build all that up into a plant that makes makes energy.\N我们能把所有这些整合成一个发电厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's that whole stacks enabling this entire industry.\N而这正是整个技术栈赋能整个产业的关键所在。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.72,0:54:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's go a little bit deeper into these challenges, because I mean,\N所以让我们深入探讨一下这些挑战，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.29,0:54:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,putting a complex machine together is obviously very complicated, but you also have to produce it at the same time.\N因为组装一台复杂的机器显然非常复杂，你还必须同时完成生产。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.16,0:54:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you have to design and manufacture and that's what you do.\N所以你得设计并制造，这正是你们所做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.52,0:54:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also with the software from Siemens.\N还有西门子的软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.76,0:54:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that that's right.\N所以没错，就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This infusion, we're developing an entire new industry.\N这种注入，我们正在打造一个全新的产业。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.72,0:54:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't just go and buy a fusion plant or a fusion part.\N你不能随便去买一个核聚变装置或核聚变部件。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.00,0:54:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We actually have to take it from, you know, the first principles of how do these magnets work?\N实际上，我们必须从最基本的原理出发，弄清楚这些磁铁是如何工作的。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.44,0:55:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you manufacture them in a factory that can take new designs really quickly, that can iterate really quickly,\N如何在一家工厂里快速制造它们，这家工厂能迅速接纳新设计，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can compare test results, the simulation tools and see where there's a mismatch.\N快速迭代，对比测试结果与仿真工具，发现其中的差异。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.64,0:55:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What we don't understand.\N我们所不了解的。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.00,0:55:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this produces a huge amount of data.\N这会产生大量数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It produces a huge amount of insight.\N它产生了海量的洞察。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.80,0:55:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now how do you harness that.\N那么，你该如何驾驭这种力量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.24,0:55:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's where we use Siemens technology from the design of the actual parts to how the factory runs,\N这就是我们运用西门子技术的地方，从零部件的设计，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.28,0:55:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to how the plant itself is controlling, you know,\N到工厂的运行方式，再到整个工厂如何控制大量电流和冷却系统，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.15,0:55:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,very large amounts of current and cooling to, you know, hold this star inside of it. Right.\N以稳定地将这颗恒星束缚在其中。没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.48,0:55:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was walking, one of your plants where you built SPARC, which is your first demonstrator,\N实际上，我正在参观你们的一处工厂，那里你们建成了 SPARC，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.95,0:55:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,where you really create more energy than you put in, which is make a viability check of your technology.\N这是你们的第一个示范装置，真正实现了输出能量大于输入能量，从而验证了技术的可行性。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.68,0:55:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and it's amazing what you do.\N而且，你所做的一切真是令人惊叹。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.84,0:55:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, imagine that the next one is even two times bigger.\N而且想象一下，下一个模型可能还要大两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.28,0:55:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.\N难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.48,0:55:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell me a little bit more about how Siemens technology played in, in that in designing it.\N所以能再详细讲讲西门子的技术在设计过程中起到了什么作用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, in supporting the manufacturing as well.\N当然，还包括对制造业的支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.60,0:56:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. So we're building a plant in Massachusetts.\N对，我们正在马萨诸塞州建一座工厂。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.88,0:56:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is a, machine that will make more power out from fusion.\N有一种机器，能从核聚变中产生更多电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.00,0:56:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,That takes the heat it up and to do that,\N这会使其升温，而要实现这一点，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.29,0:56:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens was there from the beginning of how do we actually do the design work?\N西门子从一开始就参与进来，思考如何真正开展设计工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.64,0:56:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're there in the factory with the PLCs that automate the factory.\N它们就在工厂里，与自动化工厂的可编程逻辑控制器（PLC）相伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.92,0:56:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is the factory that, you know, has engineers standing right next to the equipment that's\N这就是工厂，工程师们就站在运行设备旁边，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.90,0:56:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,running, that's being reconfigured all the time.\N这些设备一直在不断重新配置。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.36,0:56:27.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then in the actual SPARC facility, the the brains that are actually running all the different processes,\N然后在实际的 SPARC 设施中，真正运行各种流程的“大脑”必须全部协同工作，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.61,0:56:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has to all come together to make the right conditions of a star inside of it.\N才能在其中创造出类似恒星的正确条件。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.24,0:56:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those machines are our Siemens machines, and they're running, software that has been checked out and large\N那些机器是我们的西门子设备，运行着经过验证的软件，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.80,0:56:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,computer simulations accelerated by Nvidia, computation and DeepMind.\N并通过英伟达的计算和DeepMind加速了大型计算机模拟。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.72,0:56:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's a very big, stack all the way from idea to a plant.\N它是一个非常庞大的体系，从创意到工厂，一整套完整流程。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.08,0:56:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now here comes the key question when we'll see we will see real world impact.\N那么现在关键的问题来了，我们何时才能看到真正的现实影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.88,0:56:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,When will that commercially be viable.\N那什么时候才能实现商业化？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's a great question.\N所以这是个很好的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.60,0:57:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A question I always get.\N我经常被问到的一个问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.56,0:57:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the key part is that you can start to see things today.\N关键在于，你现在就能开始看到效果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we have the plant in Massachusetts factory running.\N所以我们马萨诸塞州的工厂正在正常运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.52,0:57:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the the SPARC facility is being put together and in fact at CES we have pieces of it that we've\N但SPARC设施正在组装中，实际上在CES上，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.63,0:57:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,brought and there's Siemens booth. Go check them out.\N我们已经带来了部分组件，就在西门子展台，大家可以去看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.36,0:57:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we also announced yesterday that we've put the first big magnet into place for SPARC.\N但我们昨天还宣布，已将SPARC项目的第一块大型磁体安装到位。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.88,0:57:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can see it coming together.\N所以你可以看到它正在逐渐成形。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.60,0:57:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's setting up for the next machine, which is going to be in Virginia.\N这为下一台机器的部署做准备，那台机器将位于弗吉尼亚州。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.60,0:57:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's we call ARC.\N这就是我们所说的 ARC。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a commercial machine that will make about 400MW of fusion power,\N这是一台商用机器，可产生约400兆瓦的聚变电力，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.47,0:57:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,electricity that can power a data center.\N足以为一个数据中心供电。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.16,0:57:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, that Google has agreed to buy the power from ARC.\N事实上，谷歌已同意从 ARC 购买电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.92,0:57:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is getting started here soon.\N这很快就要开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.44,0:57:46.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we can see out here on this technical stack,\N因此我们可以看到，在这个技术架构中，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.97,0:57:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,going from science all the way to energy, we can see a new age of abundance.\N从科学到能源，正展现出一个全新的丰裕时代。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Bob, thank you very much.\N所以，鲍勃，非常感谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of customers counting on you to make that work, and we are here to support.\N有很多客户正依赖你们让这件事成功，我们也会全力支持。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.68,0:57:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the partnership.\N感谢合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.35,0:58:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.\N谢谢。谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.56,0:58:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, but but even if we have abundant clean energy,\N但即使我们拥有充足的清洁能源，
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.20,0:58:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's another huge bottleneck grid availability and grid stability.\N还有一个巨大的瓶颈，那就是电网的可用性和稳定性。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.36,0:58:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, many electricity grids are on the verge of collapse,\N如今，许多电网正濒临崩溃，而太阳能、
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.60,0:58:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and intermittent energy sources like solar wind are increasing the stress on our grids.\N风能等间歇性能源的增加，正在加大电网的负担。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.84,0:58:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to predict loads better and stabilize the grid, and that's in real time.\N我们需要更准确地预测负荷并实时稳定电网。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:40.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our industrially AI enabled technologies can do this even for huge grids and autonomously.\N我们工业级的AI赋能技术甚至可以自动完成大规模电网的这项工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.40,0:58:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can simulate the impact of adding 10,000 electric vehicles to the neighborhood.\N我们可以模拟在社区中增加一万辆电动汽车的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.76,0:58:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Buildings all over the city can act together and coordinate energy consumption,\N城市里的建筑可以协同运作，协调用电，
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they could turn down their air conditioning for just half a minute to help stabilizing the grid.\N只需暂停空调半分钟，就能帮助稳定电网。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And already today, we are using AI to maximize existing grid capacity by 20% without new infrastructure.\N如今，我们已经利用人工智能，在不新建基础设施的情况下，将现有电网容量利用率提升了20%。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.04,0:59:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is industrial AI creating impact in the real world.\N这是工业AI在现实世界中创造实际影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what does this all mean for you?\N这一切对你意味着什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.08,0:59:28.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter whether you design, engineer, or operate or all of the the three,\N无论你是从事设计、工程还是运营，或是三者兼有；
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.94,0:59:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter what you make food, cars, medicine, energy, no matter what type of infrastructure you manage,\N无论你制造食品、汽车、药品还是能源；无论你管理的是供水系统、
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.36,0:59:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the water supply, a transportation system or a grid.\N交通系统还是电网，都离不开这一核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have the technology, domain knowhow and the partners to help you do what you do,\N我们拥有技术、行业专长以及合作伙伴，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.46,0:59:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but faster, more efficiently and more sustainably.\N能够帮助您更快、更高效、更可持续地完成您的工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.88,1:00:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,By scaling industrial AI in the real world.\N通过在现实世界中规模化工业AI。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.32,1:00:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity.\N电力。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.88,1:00:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, for those of us in this room barely think about it.\N今天，在座的各位几乎都不会去想这件事。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.40,1:00:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our lights turn on, our coffee machines run, our computers charge.\N我们的灯亮了，咖啡机运转，电脑开始充电。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.96,1:00:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity is a fact of life.\N电力是生活中的常态。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soon industrial AI will become a fact of life.\N不久之后，工业AI将成为生活的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will produce only what's needed, exactly what's needed, where it's needed.\N我们将仅生产所需之物，精准满足所需，就在所需之处生产。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.36,1:00:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Equipment failures and outages will be rare, unpredicted ones.\N设备故障和停机将极为罕见，且难以预测。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even rarer medicine tailored to your unique biology will just be standard health care.\N更为个性化的药物将根据你的独特生物学特征定制，这将成为标准医疗服务。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.44,1:00:53.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Autonomous vehicles will move with 100% reliability and zero emissions,\N自动驾驶汽车将实现100%的可靠性且零排放，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.17,1:01:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and knowledge will transfer through generations as naturally as current through a wire.\N知识将像电流通过导线一样，自然地代代传承。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.64,1:01:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Energy will flow cleanly, abundantly to infrastructure that repairs and optimizes itself and serves a\N能源将清洁而充足地流向那些能够自我修复和优化的基础设施，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.09,1:01:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,world so defined by AI that we hardly notice it anymore.\N服务于一个被人工智能深刻定义的世界，以至于我们几乎不再察觉它的存在。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.88,1:01:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,When a breakthrough innovation becomes a real world essential and a general purpose technology\N当一项突破性创新成为现实世界中不可或缺的要素，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.92,1:01:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,becomes the invisible fabric of our lives,\N当一种通用技术悄然融入我们生活的方方面面，那时我们才会真正意识到，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.52,1:01:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's when we will know that we have scaled AI in the real world and realized its potentials.\NAI已在现实世界中实现规模化，并释放出其全部潜力。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.56,1:01:46.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And together with our customers, with our partners, with you, transformed the everyday for everyone.\N与我们的客户、合作伙伴以及你们一起，让每个人的日常都焕然一新。
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.88,1:01:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\N谢谢。
